{
  "name": "entry",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "description": "cui Gallery entry module (ArkTS shell: XComponent surface + platform channel).",
  "main": "",
  "author": "cui",
  "license": "",
  // 'libcui_core.so' 的模块名必须与 napi 注册名一致（见 src/platform/services/
  // ohos_channel.cpp 里的 napi_module "cui_core" 与 ArkTS 侧 import cui_core from
  // 'libcui_core.so'）。类型声明走 ets/cui_core/libcui.d.ts：那个目录被当成
  // types-only 包（oh-package.json5 里 name = "libcui_core.so"、types 指向
  // libcui.d.ts），所以声明的**唯一真身处**仍是 libcui.d.ts。
  // ⚠️ 若 native 那批改用自己的 cpp/types/libcui 包，删掉本条依赖与
  //    src/main/ets/cui_core/oh-package.json5，别让模块名重复定义两次。
  "dependencies": {
    "libcui_core.so": "file:./src/main/ets/cui"
  }
}
